      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think that first of all we need to enter a gesture system detection for «Emote», «Emoji» and «Gestures Override». Now, in order to wave to someone, I have to go to the main menu and then to the submenu «Emote» to select «WAVE». It would be much faster to press and hold the «G» key and make zigzag movements with the mouse to start the «WAVE-Emote». However, there are concerns that gesture recognition will not be accurate and «DIE» will be started instead of «WAVE».",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
