  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be real awesome to have a gesture detection system, which can trigger events or animations. This opens up possibillities for combat systems, funny animation (like dabbing and the system detects the movement as \"dab\" and triggers an avatar animation) or other fun games like let's dance or sth. \n\nSecond thing is for combat system to activate like skills or magic or block or sth. It would bring more life into the game as players can interact more. (Thinking of SAO on this point). HP/MP (with UI) and inventory would be awesome aswell. \n\nWith gestures we can also extend the few controls, which gives us more possibillities and immersion into the VR world.\n\nAfter the implemention it could get just bigger - think of tournaments, global ranks etc. I love VRC for the Social components, but extending in other ways won't hurt I guess. The ones who just want to chat can still do, the other ones can fight against or maybe mobs in the world which would be even more awesome.",
